      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"5\">Level 5 - Interview-ready</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">75 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Interview page</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">35 Q&amp;A + 20-question ID quiz</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Design Patterns Interview Questions &amp; Quiz</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">The pattern questions people really reported from LLD rounds in 2024-2026, a five-beat way to answer any \"which pattern?\" question, 35 filterable Q&amp;A with how-to-answer notes, a 20-question \"name that pattern\" quiz, and drills for the moments that go wrong.</p>\n  <p>Built from <a href=\"https://leetcode.com/discuss/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LeetCode Discuss</a> interview reports (each one linked with its date) and our pattern research. Reported at <span class=\"chip\">Amazon</span> <span class=\"chip\">Uber</span> <span class=\"chip\">Walmart</span> <span class=\"chip\">Razorpay</span> <span class=\"chip\">Salesforce</span> <span class=\"chip\">Zomato</span> <span class=\"chip\">Goldman Sachs</span> <span class=\"chip\">Microsoft</span> <span class=\"chip\">Oracle</span>.</p>\n"
  },
